# Keep line endings exactly as authored.
#
# verify-deployed.cjs compares the deployed plugin copy against this source tree
# byte for byte. Git's default autocrlf on Windows would rewrite LF to CRLF on
# checkout, so the two trees would differ and the verification would fail for a
# reason that has nothing to do with the plugin. Disabling text conversion keeps
# both trees byte-identical on every platform.
* -text
